volatility.  \par \par \uc2 He said \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market for a while but would act if it felt it necessary.  \par \par \uc2 The yen's sharp gains against the dollar have prompted Finance Minister Sadakazu Tanigaki to say he is keeping an eye on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|U|NAT|J|RNP|DNP|PTD  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060228e22s000rt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
