s, while declining to comment whether \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb yen weakness.  \par \par \uc2 ($1=115.85 yen) [20051031 100220 GMT]  \par \par \uc2 [20051031 100241 GMT]  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-\b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|J|ABN|E|RBN|U|M|D|NAT|RNP|DNP|PTD|ECONOMY-\b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  =2|LANGEN|J|DNP|chained  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051031e1av000x4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
