ight\uc2  to levels that authorities will feel anxious about.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar strengthened to a fresh 25-month high against the yen Wednesday at 115.98 yen and is up 6.7% in the last six weeks. It fell to 115.38 yen late yesterday in New York, up slightly from 115.27 yen Wednesday. For now, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to keep its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  purely verbal. If the dollar's strengthening takes it near 120 yen, it isn't inconceivable authorities would step in.   \par \par \uc2 In other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the euro strengthened to $1.2015 from $1.2003 late Wednesday, while the dollar weakened to 1.2882 Swiss francs from 1.2937 francs.   \par \par \uc2 ---   \par \par \uc2 Azam Ahmed and Leika Kihara contributed to this article.   \par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires   \par \par \uc2 10-20-05 1937ET   \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020051020e1ak009tf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
