ls for repatriating overseas profits. ($1=113.27 Yen)  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-\b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|J|ABN|E|RBN|U|M|D|NAT|RNP|DNP|PTD  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050930e19u000r9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
